  "description": "Front end only for Dotnet Report, the embedded analytics and ad-hoc reporting solution for ASP.NET Core.\n\n      This package contains the report builder and dashboard UI: the JavaScript, CSS, images and Razor views, the two page controllers that serve those views, and the gulpfile and npm package list for the client libraries. It has no NuGet dependencies.\n\n      Use it in the web project that hosts your views when your solution keeps the UI and the .NET API in separate projects, together with dotnetreport.backend in the API project. You can also use it to take UI updates only. For a single-project install, use the full dotnetreport package.",
  "id": "dotnetreport.frontend",
